  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Rapid Rockets are defensive buildings in the Clan Capital, unlocked at Capital Hall level 4. These are essentially a more powerful Air Defense, but with a shorter range. Upon detecting aerial enemies, it fires bursts of five rockets at them."
  ],
